🛠️ Troubleshooting Guide
Issue / Error Symptom	Root Cause	Solution
yum install: error: the following arguments are required: PACKAGE	The shell command did not properly capture the Jenkins parameter variable (evaluated to empty).	Ensure the parameter is explicitly enclosed in braces as ${PACKAGE} rather than unquoted $PACKAGE.
Host key verification failed or connection hangs	The remote host fingerprint has changed or has not been accepted by the Jenkins user session.	Include -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no in your SSH command string to automatically accept and store the host key.
sshpass: command not found	The sshpass utility is missing from the local Jenkins instance container or server environment.	Install sshpass via system package manager (e.g., sudo apt-get install sshpass or sudo yum install sshpass) or configure SSH key-based authentication.
Permission Denied / Authentication Failure	Incorrect remote username or password provided in the SSH connection string.	Verify the target credentials against the infrastructure sheet (natasha / Bl@kW).
